    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_002-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.702Z">there was progress.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">At the time of progress, there was not yet Heaven and Earth,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">nor were there yet active movements;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">they issued from emptiness and stillness,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">becoming one as if in silence,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">misty and still in their sameness,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">and there was not yet light, nor yet proliferation.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">*Qì* actually arose from itself;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">*Héng* never produced *qì*.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.703Z">*Qì* is self-born and self-acting.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">Within *Héng*,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">the birth of *qì*</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">did not occur in isolation.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">Spaces</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">were in *Héng*;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">those that gave birth to spaces were the same.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">Murky and unsettled,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">they sought that which they produced.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">Difference produced difference,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">returning produced returning,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.704Z">opposition produced opposition,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">sorrow produced sorrow,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">dependence produced dependence;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">seeking desires, they returned to themselves:</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">Returning</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">is the movement of the birth of life.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">Turbid *qì* produced the Earth;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">clear *qì* produced Heaven.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">How spiritual is *qì* indeed!</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">In profusion, things produce one another.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">It truly fills Heaven and Earth;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.705Z">they come from the same source but have different natures,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_003-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">and produce according to their desires.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">Distinct are Heaven and Earth,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">in chaotic profusion</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">are the many things of various colors.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">Those that came first had goodness;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">there was order and no disorder;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">once there were humans, there was non-goodness;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">disorder issued from humans.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">First there was the internal,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.706Z">then there was the external.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">First there was the small,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">then there was the great.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">First there was the soft,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">then there was the hard.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">First there was the round,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">then there was the square.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">First there was the dark,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">then there was the light.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.707Z">First there was the short,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">then there was the long.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">Once Heaven and Earth were established,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">they remained as one because of the One;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">they remained as returning because of returning.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">The birth of *Héng* and *qì*</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">followed</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">the return of their desires.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">Brilliant is the movement of Heaven;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">it is through returning that it is never discarded.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_004-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z">Once wisdom is attained, to cease thinking is not in accordance with Heaven.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.708Z"/>
