    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">intent issues from nature;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">words issue from intent;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">names issue from words;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">affairs issue from names.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">If a "perhaps" is not a "perhaps,"</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">then do not call it a "perhaps."</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">If existence is not existence,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">then do not call it existence.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">If nature is not nature,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">then do not call it nature.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">If intent is not intent,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">then do not call it intent.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.709Z">If words are not words,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">then do not call them words.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">If a name is not a name,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">then do not call it a name.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">If an affair is not an affair,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_005-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">then do not call it an affair.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z"/>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">Carefully investigating righteousness and profit as the primary concern,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">things of various colors issue from action;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">where there is action, there are affairs;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">without action, there are no affairs.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">In all affairs of the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">taking self-action as an affair</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.71Z">is a principle that cannot be changed.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">Whenever names precede, there is a model;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">when words follow recklessly, they must be compared and corrected.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">All names in the world are empty designations;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">through habit, they cannot be altered.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">Of all the forceful actions in the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">if they result in the great works of the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">their flourishing diversity does not arise from acting like themselves;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">whether they succeed or fail,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">neither state is discarded.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">Of all the activities in the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.711Z">there is no abandonment,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">and no giving,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">yet they are able to act of themselves.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">The birth of all things in the world is the same;</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">in their affairs, there is nothing that does not return.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">In all the actions of the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">do not oppose the ultimate,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">and do not act against one's proper place.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">In all the actions of the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">there are none that do not attain their constancy and thus achieve their result.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">Some may attain it,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">and some may lose it.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">Of all the names in the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.712Z">none are ever discarded.</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.713Z">Of all the enlightened kings, enlightened lords, and enlightened scholars of the world,</seg>
    <seg corresp="#CH8x4540_CHANT_006-1a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-gemini-3-flash-preview" generatedBy="bot-gemini-3-flash-preview" modified="2026-04-29T22:35:33.713Z">none seek anything without considering it.</seg>
  </p>
